<title>FINLAND: Niinisto denies flagging Finnish marka-ERM link.</title>
<headline>Niinisto denies flagging Finnish marka-ERM link.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish Finance Minister Sauli Niinisto on Friday denied a report which quoted him as saying outright that Finland will link the markka to ERM this autumn.</p>
<p>Niinisto was quoted as saying that &quot;the government has signalled that the link will happen in the autumn&quot;, but he told Reuters by telephone that he had &quot;certainly not said that&quot;.</p>
<p>&quot;The interview was done some three weeks ago ... and that sounds really unfamiliar to me,&quot; he said, asked by Reuters to comment on the interview to be published in Monday's newsletter of a big central trade union, the Finnish Confederation of Salaried Employees (STTK).</p>
</text>
